    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Hadi Bux Jatoi, Director General Health of Sindh, inaugurated the Maternal and Child Health (MCH) Centre, established by Aga Khan University (AKU) in conjunction with the local community, in Nara Taluka of district Khairpur. The Centre aims to benefit the community of this remote and underdeveloped area and was funded by a multinational, Lasmo Oil Pakistan Limited, which is operating in the same area. The MCH Centre establisment is one of the initiatives of the Lasmo funded Rural Community Development Project run by AKU's Department of Community Health Sciences. The project seeks to establish a primary health care network with the Centre as its focal point of village based activities",
